UID:kos-kardamena-panigiri-of-genesio-tis-theotokou-kardamena-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270907
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270909
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Genesio tis Theotokou\, Kardamena
LOCATION:Kardamena\, Kos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Kardamena's parish feast on 7-8 September is the one night the resort belongs to the locals: vespers at the Panagia church\, then a glendi with island music on the square. In early October the same village holds its smelt (marida) festival with free fried fish by the harbour.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kos/#kardamena-panigiri-of-genesio-tis-theotokou-kardamena
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kos/#kardamena-panigiri-of-genesio-tis-theotokou-kardamena
END:VEVENT
